# Brazen Blademaster: "Whenever this creature attacks while you control two or more artifacts, it gets +2/+1 until end of turn."
# Bot1 pays for it with Mox Ruby, Mox Jet and a Mountain, so it attacks on turn 3 controlling exactly two artifacts (the boundary): it
# becomes a 4/4 until end of turn (CR 611.2a) and deals 4. The pump lasts until end of turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mountain
Brazen Blademaster
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Brazen Blademaster.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Brazen Blademaster > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Brazen Blademaster.Power = 4
? Bot1.Battlefield.Brazen Blademaster.Toughness = 4

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 16
Bot1.Battlefield.Brazen Blademaster.Power = 4
